- Hey, excuse you!
- We are humanity's last hope.

283
00:15:26,676 --> 00:15:28,075
Our mission?
Destroy all cy-bugs.

284
00:15:29,878 --> 00:15:31,712
We are humanity's last hope.

285
00:15:31,714 --> 00:15:34,915
