Pretty shiny.

297
00:15:58,875 --> 00:16:00,774
Ooh! And it says "Hero" on it?

298
00:16:00,776 --> 00:16:02,042
Uh-huh.

299
00:16:02,044 --> 00:16:04,245
And you say you win it
