437
00:24:30,185 --> 00:24:32,686
From the game <i>Fix-It Felix, Jr.</i>

438
00:24:34,023 --> 00:24:36,723
Jiminey jaminey!

439
00:24:36,725 --> 00:24:40,761
Look at that high definition.
Your face!

440
00:24:40,763 --> 00:24:43,663
It's amazing!

441
