479
00:28:14,810 --> 00:28:16,743
Oh no! My medal!

480
00:28:19,680 --> 00:28:22,282
No, no, no, no, my medal!

481
00:28:26,388 --> 00:28:27,520
No, no, my medal!

482
00:28:49,377 --> 00:28:49,976
