486
00:29:00,956 --> 00:29:02,622
Ralph. Wreck-It Ralph.

487
00:29:02,624 --> 00:29:04,958
You're not from here, are you?

488
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:07,961
No, well, yeah. I mean,
I mean not from right in this area.

489
00:29:07,963 --> 00:29:09,329
